  {
    "find": "Post-merge, stale-read windows the old flow never exposed now surface under concurrent checkout load, which the integration suite, running 3 parallel workers, reliably reproduces.",
    "replace": "After the merge, stale-read windows that the old flow never exposed now appear under concurrent checkout load. The integration suite reliably reproduces this with 3 parallel workers.",
