  {
    "find": "Implementations the standard libraries ship typically trigger a resize at 0.75, a threshold empirical lookup-latency degradation analysis motivates.",
    "replace": "The implementations that standard libraries ship typically trigger a resize at 0.75. This threshold is based on empirical analysis of how lookup latency degrades.",
